      },
      "worked": "For $(x-3)^8$,\n$$T_k=\\binom{8}{k}x^{8-k}(-3)^k.$$\nThe $x^6$ term has $k=2$, so its coefficient is $\\binom{8}{2}(-3)^2=252$.\n\nFor $(x+2)^8$,\n$$T_k=\\binom{8}{k}x^{8-k}2^k.$$\nThe $x^6$ term has $k=2$, so its coefficient is $\\binom{8}{2}2^2=112$.\n\nThe required coefficient is\n$$\\begin{align*}252-112&=140.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
